        "subject": "=🚨 [URGENT] {{ $json.workflowName }} - Production Failure Alert",
        "message": "=<h3>🚨 Critical Production Error Detected</h3>\n<p>An automated workflow encountered a failure and requires immediate attention.</p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"8\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-family: sans-serif;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><strong>Workflow Name</strong></td>\n    <td>{{ $json.workflowName }}</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><strong>Execution ID</strong></td>\n    <td>{{ $json.executionId }}</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><strong>Failing Node</strong></td>\n    <td>{{ $json.nodeName }}</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><strong>Error Message</strong></td>\n    <td><span style=\"color: red;\">{{ $json.errorMessage }}</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><strong>Timestamp</strong></td>\n    <td>{{ $json.timestamp }}</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 15px;\">\n  <a href=\"http://localhost:5678/workflow/{{ $json.workflowId }}/executions/{{ $json.executionId }}\" \n     style=\"background-color: #e03131; color: white; padding: 10px 15px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block;\">\n    🔍 Open Execution #{{ $json.executionId }} in n8n\n  </a>\n</p>",
