    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "📌 CENTRALIZED ERROR HANDLER & PRODUCTION FAIL-SAFE\n\n🎯 Business Problem:\nIn production, workflows break silently due to expired API keys, dead endpoints, or corrupt payloads. Without centralized monitoring, broken automations go unnoticed for days, resulting in lost revenue and broken client trust.\n\n🚀 The Solution:\nA account-wide automated fail-safe monitor:\n1. Error Trigger catches failures across all connected production workflows instantly.\n2. JavaScript Code node extracts diagnostic metadata (Workflow Name, Execution ID, Failing Node, Raw Error Message).\n3. Google Sheets appends a timestamped audit record to central log file.\n4. Gmail node triggers an urgent HTML diagnostic alert directly to engineering.\n\n💰 Business Impact & ROI:\n• 99.9% System Uptime & Silent Failure Prevention.\n• Near-zero MTTR (Mean Time To Repair).\n• Proactive incident detection before clients notice issues.",
        "height": 544,
        "width": 592,
        "color": "#B81929"
      },
